                <pb facs="0755" n="645" sameAs="frus:frus1890/pg645"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Adee to Mr.
                            Ryan.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1890-07-27"><hi rendition="#italic">July</hi> 27,
                        1890</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. Ryan is instructed, with the aid of Mr. Mizner, to make inquiries as to the
                    cause and the responsibility of the stopping of communication between Washington
                    and Central America.</p>
            </div>
